 k) "a question like \"how much went into the brokerage this year\" CAN now be
    answered from the ledger tools (get_transfers)" and "answered by filtering to
    checking and reading total_in", "positive = money received into this account,
    negative = money sent out" -- TRUE, driven against a pattern-backed pair:
