      get_transfers {"account_id":"checking"}  -> total_in 700, total_out -3000, net -2300
      get_transfers {"account_id":"brokerage"} -> total_in 3000, total_out 0, net 3000
    The question is answered (3000 into the brokerage) and the signs follow bank
